
# Paymaster that pays network fees for users who signed in with a passkey.
# Without it, sign-in still works but a new user cannot afford their first
# transaction — so this is what makes signing in actually usable.
#
# Any ERC-7677 paymaster service URL. With Pimlico it is per-chain:
#   https://api.pimlico.io/v2/base/rpc?apikey=YOUR_KEY          (Base, 8453)
#   https://api.pimlico.io/v2/optimism/rpc?apikey=YOUR_KEY      (Optimism, 10)
#
# The key is visible to anyone who opens the page — that is inherent to a
# browser paymaster and is why the sponsorship policy lives in the provider's
# dashboard, not here. Restrict it there to this app's contract addresses and
# an explicit list of function selectors, and set a daily cap. Without that,
# anyone can point their own dapp at your key and spend it.
#
# Absent is a supported state: everyone simply pays their own fees, exactly as
# before.
REACT_APP_PAYMASTER_URL=
